{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56129","headline":"步虚词 二十二 · 杜光庭","name":"步虚词 二十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天真帝一宫，蔼蔼冠耀灵。\n流涣法轮网，旋空入无形。\n虚皇抚云璈，衆真诵洞经。\n高仙凛手赞，弥刼保利贞。\n（同前卷二四。\n同书卷九作《三啓颂》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56129.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56129","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}